<HTML>
<HEAD>
   <TITLE>Help Firmware Version </TITLE>
   <META content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type">
   <LINK href="helpStyle.css" rel="stylesheet" title="WebEnabled" type="text/css">
</HEAD>
<BODY>
   <TABLE border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
      <!-- Begin logos row - middle logo is instrument specific -->
      <TR bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
         <TD bgcolor="#FFFFFF" height="60" valign="MIDDLE" width="230">
            <IMG alt="Agilent" border="0" height="60" src="../image/agilent.gif" width="230">
         </TD>
         <TD bgcolor="#336699" class="blue" height="60" valign="top">
            <IMG alt="" src="../image/instrumentBanner.gif"></TD>
      </TR>
      <!-- End logos row -->
      <TR>
         <TD bgcolor="#336699" class="blue" colspan="2">
            <IMG alt="" height="2" src="../image/filltrans.gif"></TD>
      </TR>
   </TABLE>
   <H1>
      Firmware Version Help</H1>
   <P>
      <B>Firmware Version </B>provides a convenient means to check and upgrade the firmware
      for your instrument. Firmware upgrade are available for download from 
      <A href="http://www.agilent.com/find/<%=sModelSeries%>X-Series-sw" target="_blank">
         <%=sModel%>&nbsp;software page</A>. Keep your firmware up to date to enjoy the
      best performance from your instrument.
   </P>
   <P>
      We recommend that you download the firmware file to your computer and then use this
      web page to install the file in the instrument.
   </P>
</BODY>
</HTML>
